---
---

<section class="section" id="products">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">What You Research</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Two research modes</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Player props and team game lines — same research-card idea, different signals.
    </p>

    <div class="spotlight">
      <article class="card spotlight__card">
        <p class="spotlight__label">Prop Markets</p>
        <h3 class="spotlight__title">Research player Over/Under props</h3>
        <ul class="spotlight__list">
          <li>Hit rates and trend flags for the leaned side</li>
          <li>Best line and price from tracked books</li>
          <li>Home/away clears and relevant player injuries</li>
          <li>Market Read — Opportunity, Worth Watching, or Potential Pass</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#prop-markets" class="spotlight__link">See prop card sections →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card spotlight__card spotlight__card--game-lines">
        <p class="spotlight__label">Game Lines</p>
        <h3 class="spotlight__title">Research team moneyline, spread, and total markets</h3>
        <ul class="spotlight__list">
          <li>Venue and head-to-head records in plain language</li>
          <li>Best odds per side with split-market ranges when books disagree</li>
          <li>Opposing team or direction context on every card</li>
          <li>Relevant injuries for both teams in the matchup</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#game-lines" class="spotlight__link">See game line card sections →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .spotlight {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .spotlight__card {
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }

  .spotlight__card--game-lines {
    border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);
    background: linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(17, 24, 34, 1) 0%, rgba(12, 18, 28, 1) 100%);
  }

  .spotlight__label {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .spotlight__title {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .spotlight__list {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .spotlight__list li + li {
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .spotlight__link {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-bright);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .spotlight__link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .spotlight {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
